  unitName: Gazolina Spray (EU)
  unitId: 720154
  unitNumber: 7088
  description: "Gazolina joined Coal Cauldron\u2019s gang, as the solitude of the
    desert was too much for her to bear. They welcomed her with open arms, and for
    a time she was happy. They enjoyed her protection, and she was able to make some
    friends. Only their leader bothered her. He was infatuated with her, but the
    stench of burnt flesh that followed him everywhere disgusted her."
  summonDesc: No one will die by my side.
  fusionDesc: "I\u2019m your best protection!"
  evoDesc: A purer water will help me better protect my allies.
